bounded by 152 meet the floor `1/77`.  Cover-capacity certificate: 32 parts, capacities
summing to 75 < 76, using 121 witness times (split style). -/
theorem dense_floor_m76_split (v : Fin 76 → ℤ) (hv : ∀ i, 0 < v i)
    (hinj : Function.Injective fun i => (v i).toNat)
    (hden : ∀ i, (v i).toNat ∈ Finset.Icc 1 152) :
    1 / (77 : ℝ) ≤ ML v := by
  have h := floor_of_cover_capacity (k := 75) (t := 32) (N := 121) v hv hinj
    (by simpa using hden) CRS76.pf CRS76.qf CRS76.hq_all CRS76.bf CRS76.hbad_all
    CRS76.Uf CRS76.cf CRS76.hcover_all CRS76.hcap_all CRS76.hsum_all
